    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Usage</h2>Use any player you like to play music, and the visualization engine will work automatically.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1.Videos &amp; Images instruction</h2><strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Video 1\uff1aRandom demonstrating effects<br></li><li> Video 2\uff1aHow to make a effect</li></ul></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Video 3&amp;4\uff1aDisplaying and making</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2.About  Rhythm Master</h2>Rhythm Master is a music visualization\u00a0software. When you listen to music in any audio/video player, it can automatically analyze the music and generate beautiful effects. The effects can not only be rendered in a window but can also be fixed at top of your desktop in transparent state. So, you can work together with music and gorgeous effects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3.Rhythm Master Features</h2><strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Support many components\uff0cinclude Image\uff0cParticle System\uff0cFrame Animation\uff0cMusic Visualization\uff0cVideo\uff0cImage Cluster...\uff0cand every component can change it\u2019s properties.<br></li><li>Support more than 50 kind of Music Visualization effects.<br></li><li>Support effect editor, you can make your own effect.<br></li><li>Support Particle System editor, you can make special Particle System.<br></li><li>You can customize the parameters of each Music Visualization component to suit your preferences.</li></ul></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Particle System can also follow the rhythm of the music to showcase dynamic visuals.<br></li><li>Support video as effect\u2019s background.<br></li><li>Support Time and Label components.<br></li><li>Support to play local music in your computer\uff0csupport more formats, such as mp3, flac, ape..<br></li><li>Support ProgressBar component.When you are playing music in Rhythm Master\uff0cthe progress of music will sync to ProgressBar.<br></li><li>Support LRC lyric for music.<br></li><li>Support 4K+ monitor</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Usage</h2>Use any player you like to play music, and the visualization engine will work automatically.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1.Videos &amp; Images instruction</h2><strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Video 1\uff1aRandom demonstrating effects<br></li><li> Video 2\uff1aHow to make a effect</li></ul></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Video 3&amp;4\uff1aDisplaying and making</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2.About  Rhythm Master</h2>Rhythm Master is a music visualization\u00a0software. When you listen to music in any audio/video player, it can automatically analyze the music and generate beautiful effects. The effects can not only be rendered in a window but can also be fixed at top of your desktop in transparent state. So, you can work together with music and gorgeous effects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3.Rhythm Master Features</h2><strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Support many components\uff0cinclude Image\uff0cParticle System\uff0cFrame Animation\uff0cMusic Visualization\uff0cVideo\uff0cImage Cluster...\uff0cand every component can change it\u2019s properties.<br></li><li>Support more than 50 kind of Music Visualization effects.<br></li><li>Support effect editor, you can make your own effect.<br></li><li>Support Particle System editor, you can make special Particle System.<br></li><li>You can customize the parameters of each Music Visualization component to suit your preferences.</li></ul></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Particle System can also follow the rhythm of the music to showcase dynamic visuals.<br></li><li>Support video as effect\u2019s background.<br></li><li>Support Time and Label components.<br></li><li>Support to play local music in your computer\uff0csupport more formats, such as mp3, flac, ape..<br></li><li>Support ProgressBar component.When you are playing music in Rhythm Master\uff0cthe progress of music will sync to ProgressBar.<br></li><li>Support LRC lyric for music.<br></li><li>Support 4K+ monitor</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy</h2>",
    "short_description": "Innovative and cutting-edge music visualization software combines your beloved music with breathtaking visual effects, adding a visual dimension to enhance your music experience.You can also choose to pin and display, allowing you to appreciate the beautiful effects while working.",
